WEBVTT

01:30.860 --> 01:34.890
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.020 --> 01:37.930
[Episode 33]

01:41.039 --> 01:42.370
Have you figured it out?

01:44.710 --> 01:45.680
No, I haven't.

01:49.229 --> 01:50.960
Then go back and keep kneeling.

02:05.150 --> 02:05.760
Father.

02:07.150 --> 02:07.760
If you

02:07.790 --> 02:08.870
don't make this clear

02:08.870 --> 02:09.590
to me today,

02:11.030 --> 02:11.940
I won't yield,

02:12.000 --> 02:14.000
no matter how long you make me kneel.

02:17.150 --> 02:19.480
You're demanding an explanation from me?

02:21.430 --> 02:23.710
I told you to keep an eye on
the salt fields in Lianghuai,

02:23.710 --> 02:24.970
but what have you done?

02:25.150 --> 02:27.350
Once you hand the salt fields over to me,

02:27.400 --> 02:29.060
I should get to call the shots.

02:29.370 --> 02:30.240
If anything happens,

02:30.240 --> 02:32.680
I'll deal with it on the spot.

02:32.710 --> 02:34.000
You shouldn't interfere.

02:34.000 --> 02:35.710
Wasn't that what we agreed upon

02:35.710 --> 02:37.280
before I left?

02:38.960 --> 02:41.160
So why are you pulling this on me again?

02:41.560 --> 02:43.700
You have to be the wisest in the world

02:43.750 --> 02:45.360
and do everything yourself, is that it?

02:45.360 --> 02:47.360
Then why did you send me there at all?

02:47.800 --> 02:48.520
Then you tell me—

02:48.520 --> 02:50.720
what have you accomplished in Nanjing?

02:51.800 --> 02:54.400
-That Viceroy...
-He wants to restore the economy of

02:54.400 --> 02:56.079
the Lianghuai region, so he won't

02:56.079 --> 02:57.470
hand over the salt fields—
his golden goose—

02:57.470 --> 02:58.070
so easily.

02:59.400 --> 03:01.260
Everyone is asking him for money.

03:01.310 --> 03:03.510
He won't cooperate, and what did you do?

03:03.800 --> 03:05.080
Have you racked your brain

03:05.080 --> 03:06.210
trying to figure out

03:06.870 --> 03:07.910
how to persuade him

03:07.910 --> 03:09.510
to hand over the salt fields?

03:12.590 --> 03:13.390
You let others

03:13.400 --> 03:15.330
lead you by the nose in everything.

03:15.430 --> 03:16.360
When they tell you to print books,
you do it.

03:16.360 --> 03:18.280
When they tell you to repair
the coastal embankment, you repair it.

03:18.280 --> 03:19.410
And the salt fields?

03:19.840 --> 03:20.560
I've strained my eyes

03:20.560 --> 03:21.560
until they're bloodshot,

03:21.560 --> 03:23.760
and I still don't see any progress, son.

03:25.400 --> 03:26.460
And another thing—

03:27.190 --> 03:28.150
you and Gu Pingyuan

03:28.150 --> 03:29.870
have teamed up

03:30.280 --> 03:31.880
to offend Yang Ten-Million.

03:31.910 --> 03:33.280
Fine, offend him if you must,

03:33.280 --> 03:35.610
but why did you have to
keep bringing it up?

03:35.750 --> 03:37.870
You shouldn't have humiliated him
like that.

03:37.870 --> 03:38.430
Father.

03:39.560 --> 03:42.030
That Yang Ten-Million is
a crooked merchant.

03:42.030 --> 03:43.710
He preys on the common people!

03:44.310 --> 03:45.360
Honestly speaking,

03:45.360 --> 03:47.420
you're neglecting your real duties.

03:48.960 --> 03:50.750
I don't want to waste time
arguing with you.

03:50.750 --> 03:51.870
I can't outwit

03:52.400 --> 03:53.360
the Viceroy of Liangjiang.

03:53.360 --> 03:54.870
If you want to fight, go do it yourself.

03:54.870 --> 03:55.710
But aside from that,

03:55.710 --> 03:56.710
I believe

03:56.800 --> 03:57.960
I did nothing wrong.

03:59.240 --> 04:00.630
Gu Pingyuan—

04:01.120 --> 04:03.380
you think he's someone easy to deal with?

04:07.470 --> 04:09.750
The Viceroy of Liangjiang
pulled some strings with an official

04:09.750 --> 04:10.560
from the Ministry of Rites to get him

04:10.560 --> 04:12.090
an Associate Jinshi title.

04:16.630 --> 04:18.190
From now on, when you meet him—a Jinshi—

04:18.190 --> 04:19.630
no matter how big a merchant you are,

04:19.630 --> 04:21.430
you must kneel and kowtow to him!

04:23.040 --> 04:23.800
See?

04:24.690 --> 04:26.240
Elevate one while crushing the other—

04:26.240 --> 04:27.370
look at his tactics.

04:28.390 --> 04:30.850
It's one thing
if you can't see through this,

04:30.950 --> 04:31.750
but you're still

04:31.750 --> 04:33.270
sticking your neck out.

04:35.510 --> 04:36.950
Father, that's impossible.

04:36.950 --> 04:38.070
He's just a convict.

04:38.070 --> 04:39.159
At most, they'd restore
his household registry.

04:39.159 --> 04:39.750
How could he possibly

04:39.750 --> 04:41.080
be given Jinshi status?

04:41.830 --> 04:43.159
Changing someone's credentials
isn't that difficult.

04:43.159 --> 04:44.290
What's the big deal?

04:44.850 --> 04:46.380
And I'll tell you straight—

04:46.600 --> 04:47.560
I bought

04:47.600 --> 04:49.240
an official post for Gu Pingyuan.

04:49.240 --> 04:50.430
The Viceroy of Liangjiang

04:50.430 --> 04:51.800
used his connections and got it done.

04:51.800 --> 04:52.310
Father.

04:54.360 --> 04:55.680
Have you lost your mind?

04:55.680 --> 04:56.270
Well...

04:56.800 --> 04:58.659
Why would you spend money on that?

04:58.680 --> 04:59.610
To send him away.

05:00.040 --> 05:01.600
He can take up his post
somewhere far from here.

05:01.600 --> 05:02.920
It's better if you two never see

05:02.920 --> 05:03.920
each other again.

05:04.870 --> 05:06.310
So I won't have to worry every day

05:06.310 --> 05:07.630
about him poisoning your mind.

05:07.630 --> 05:08.510
The two of us, father and son,

05:08.510 --> 05:10.350
should work together properly

05:10.430 --> 05:11.890
to deal with that Viceroy.

05:12.870 --> 05:14.000
So the Viceroy can't

05:14.000 --> 05:15.560
keep using Gu Pingyuan against us.

05:15.560 --> 05:16.830
I don't understand at all.

05:16.830 --> 05:19.230
It doesn't matter if you don't understand.

05:19.310 --> 05:21.360
Leave Gu Pingyuan to handle
the coastal embankment repair work.

05:21.360 --> 05:23.360
You just stay at home
and attend to things here.

05:23.360 --> 05:25.000
Once we secure the salt fields,

05:25.000 --> 05:26.660
I'll put you in charge of them.

05:26.720 --> 05:28.320
Be good and do as I say, child.

05:47.270 --> 05:48.630
Kowtow to your father.

05:54.430 --> 05:56.560
When he left for the capital back then,

05:57.310 --> 05:58.240
we never heard from him again—

05:57.480 --> 06:00.570
[Memorial Tablet of Gu Wanzhang]

05:58.560 --> 06:00.160
whether he was alive or dead.

06:01.430 --> 06:02.960
You were still little then.

06:04.270 --> 06:06.470
I was still pregnant with your brother.

06:07.870 --> 06:08.720
And he just

06:09.430 --> 06:11.270
left and never returned.

06:13.000 --> 06:14.750
Some said he was still alive.

06:17.000 --> 06:18.730
Others said he died of illness.

06:21.040 --> 06:23.570
You've been thinking about him
all this time.

06:23.920 --> 06:25.780
I actually hope he's still alive.

06:28.510 --> 06:29.310
If he's alive,

06:29.430 --> 06:31.630
I'd be happy even if he never comes back.

06:34.000 --> 06:35.720
It's better than being weighed down

06:35.720 --> 06:38.720
by this uncertainty about
whether he's alive or dead.

06:40.830 --> 06:41.480
Then, I...

06:41.830 --> 06:42.800
Kowtow now.

06:55.000 --> 06:56.680
I know your father.

06:58.010 --> 07:01.680
[Memorial Tablet of Gu Wanzhang]

06:58.830 --> 07:00.960
As long as there's still breath in him,

07:01.250 --> 07:04.190
he'll crawl back if he has to.

07:06.490 --> 07:09.950
[Memorial Tablet of Gu Wanzhang]

07:10.040 --> 07:10.800
As for me...

07:14.240 --> 07:16.160
I just assume he's already dead.

07:19.930 --> 07:22.980
[Memorial Tablet of Gu Wanzhang]

07:38.800 --> 07:39.800
At that time,

07:40.190 --> 07:42.520
someone was delivering tea to the capital

07:42.720 --> 07:44.070
and met someone on the road

07:44.070 --> 07:46.130
who looked exactly like your father.

07:46.680 --> 07:48.100
So they called out to him.

07:48.510 --> 07:49.770
Your father responded

07:50.430 --> 07:51.760
and even turned around.

07:52.600 --> 07:55.090
But then he flatly denied it.

07:55.720 --> 07:58.320
The villager wouldn't let it go
just like that.

07:58.510 --> 07:59.909
They grabbed his sleeve,

08:00.390 --> 08:01.950
and after some tugging and pulling,

08:01.950 --> 08:04.120
they came to a fortune-teller's stall.

08:04.120 --> 08:05.720
The man borrowed a brush,

08:06.750 --> 08:08.750
wrote something on a piece of paper,

08:09.160 --> 08:11.360
and asked the villager to bring it back.

08:11.680 --> 08:13.280
The villager couldn't read,

08:13.920 --> 08:15.780
and as soon as they took the paper,

08:16.430 --> 08:18.600
the man seized the opportunity
to run away.

08:18.600 --> 08:20.800
So the villager brought the paper back.

08:22.720 --> 08:24.380
Such beautiful handwriting.

08:24.920 --> 08:27.050
"Life flickers like a candle's flame;

08:27.720 --> 08:29.920
its brilliance fades as the light dies.

08:30.510 --> 08:32.909
Spring breeze circles around the treetops;

08:32.909 --> 08:34.710
days pass as nature transforms.

08:35.390 --> 08:36.990
Only greedy for rain and dew;

08:38.030 --> 08:40.440
unaware of the withering end."

08:42.789 --> 08:43.360
Mother,

08:43.390 --> 08:43.840
this poem...

08:43.840 --> 08:45.630
Mr. Bai read it

08:46.720 --> 08:48.250
and said it was a ghost poem.

08:49.240 --> 08:50.080
A ghost poem?

08:50.870 --> 08:52.930
Life flickers like a candle's flame;

08:54.000 --> 08:56.000
its brilliance fades as the light dies.

08:56.000 --> 08:58.200
If that isn't a ghost speaking, what is?

09:01.320 --> 09:02.880
After Mr. Bai read this poem,

09:01.490 --> 09:02.840
[Life flickers like a candle's flame;]

09:02.840 --> 09:04.200
[its brilliance fades as the light dies.]

09:02.910 --> 09:03.960
he told me,

09:04.480 --> 09:05.600
"Mrs. Gu,

09:07.030 --> 09:08.230
stop looking for him.

09:09.390 --> 09:11.510
Your husband is dead."

09:22.120 --> 09:23.080
I never even knew

09:23.790 --> 09:25.250
such a thing had happened.

09:28.480 --> 09:30.870
What difference would it have made
if you'd known?

09:30.870 --> 09:32.400
Neither your father nor you

09:33.440 --> 09:36.100
had the fate
for scholarly or official careers.

09:36.440 --> 09:37.390
He's dead.

09:39.320 --> 09:40.150
You left.

09:41.440 --> 09:42.240
We were separated

09:42.240 --> 09:43.840
for so many years.

09:44.440 --> 09:45.360
If you ask me...

09:49.120 --> 09:51.120
we should just stay home peacefully

09:51.870 --> 09:53.840
and grow tea. That's best.

10:04.070 --> 10:10.290
[Tranquility of Autumn]

10:15.120 --> 10:15.670
Wifey?

10:17.460 --> 10:18.170
Wifey,

10:18.200 --> 10:19.390
my mother lectured me again.

10:19.390 --> 10:20.870
My mind is in such turmoil.

10:22.720 --> 10:23.520
What's wrong?

10:23.870 --> 10:25.270
Are you not feeling well?

10:26.320 --> 10:26.910
No.

10:32.720 --> 10:34.180
This time, no matter what,

10:34.270 --> 10:36.070
you must help me make a decision.

10:36.440 --> 10:37.250
Just tell me,

10:37.600 --> 10:40.000
should I take
the official position or not?

10:42.000 --> 10:43.390
You're not one to chase after
official positions.

10:43.390 --> 10:44.670
Whether to take it or not—

10:44.670 --> 10:46.730
don't you already know in your heart?

10:47.030 --> 10:47.960
I really don't know,

10:47.960 --> 10:49.620
and that's why I'm asking you.

10:52.270 --> 10:53.000
Come here, let me hold you.

10:53.000 --> 10:54.060
Don't come near me.

10:54.440 --> 10:55.200
Just a hug.

10:56.030 --> 10:59.910
Wifey, I'm so tired.

11:02.270 --> 11:02.790
See?

11:03.720 --> 11:04.630
I warned you.

11:09.670 --> 11:10.360
Gentlemen.

11:11.630 --> 11:13.160
We can talk things through.

11:13.630 --> 11:15.230
Please don't hurt my family.

11:16.630 --> 11:17.630
Master Gu.

11:19.870 --> 11:21.670
We've come to congratulate you.

11:21.960 --> 11:23.160
Why are you so afraid?

11:25.550 --> 11:26.870
Oh, it's you, Ms. Su.

11:27.790 --> 11:29.190
I trust you've been well.

11:29.870 --> 11:31.670
Tell your man to lower his blade.

11:32.960 --> 11:34.220
If my family gets hurt,

11:34.550 --> 11:36.550
don't blame me for losing my temper.

11:38.270 --> 11:40.200
You two really are a loving couple.

11:40.480 --> 11:42.080
I've brought you an old acquaintance.

11:42.080 --> 11:44.120
I wonder if you're willing to meet her.

11:44.120 --> 11:45.030
An old acquaintance?

11:45.030 --> 11:46.360
What old acquaintance?

11:56.960 --> 11:57.510
Yimei.

12:03.000 --> 12:03.510
Bai...

12:04.670 --> 12:05.600
Bai Yimei?

12:14.270 --> 12:14.870
Gu,

12:15.550 --> 12:16.360
Chang,

12:17.440 --> 12:18.870
I apologize for the offense.

12:18.870 --> 12:20.670
I offer my sincerest apologies.

12:21.860 --> 12:22.500
Yimei,

12:23.150 --> 12:24.210
what are you doing?

12:28.070 --> 12:28.870
I beg you to save

12:28.870 --> 12:30.000
thousands of my men.

12:30.200 --> 12:32.530
They were all my late husband's soldiers.

12:32.720 --> 12:34.240
If you could lend a hand,

12:34.910 --> 12:36.420
I would be eternally grateful

12:36.420 --> 12:39.020
and repay your kindness
in every possible way.

12:43.030 --> 12:44.120
Ms. Su is so capable.

12:44.120 --> 12:45.320
Why don't you ask her?

12:45.550 --> 12:46.600
If even she can't help,

12:46.600 --> 12:48.330
then I certainly can't either.

12:48.600 --> 12:49.330
Besides,

12:49.480 --> 12:50.520
thousands of men?

12:50.630 --> 12:52.080
Where did you get thousands of men from?

12:52.080 --> 12:53.440
Those thousands of prisoners of war

12:53.440 --> 12:55.030
that Jiu sent to your construction site.

12:55.030 --> 12:56.390
They were General Li Cheng's

12:56.390 --> 12:57.550
loyal comrades.

12:58.320 --> 13:00.520
They were captured after Nanjing fell.

13:00.720 --> 13:02.030
Jiu has been keeping them alive.

13:02.030 --> 13:03.390
He doesn't want to
waste food on them anymore

13:03.390 --> 13:04.840
and fears public criticism
if he kills them.

13:04.840 --> 13:06.030
He's afraid the history books

13:06.030 --> 13:08.240
will record him as someone
who killed prisoners.

13:08.240 --> 13:09.200
That old fox

13:09.480 --> 13:10.550
never takes a loss.

13:11.150 --> 13:13.240
Once those men finish repairing
the coastal embankment,

13:13.240 --> 13:14.480
they'll no longer be of any use.

13:14.480 --> 13:16.410
Marshal Jiu will surely kill them.

13:17.120 --> 13:17.630
Later,

13:18.240 --> 13:19.000
he'll just claim they died

13:19.000 --> 13:20.530
at your construction site.

13:21.790 --> 13:23.450
Those men can't die like that.

13:24.960 --> 13:26.160
If they do, when I die,

13:26.960 --> 13:28.510
I won't be able to face him.

13:30.270 --> 13:30.960
Yeah,

13:31.510 --> 13:33.110
you can't face him like that.

13:33.270 --> 13:34.480
Let's set aside whether we can rescue

13:34.480 --> 13:35.880
those thousands for now.

13:36.030 --> 13:37.490
Let's say you do save them—

13:37.550 --> 13:39.150
where would you settle them?

13:39.150 --> 13:40.550
Don't tell me you want to be
a local warlord,

13:40.550 --> 13:41.810
planning a rebellion.

13:42.550 --> 13:44.080
You don't need to concern yourself with

13:44.080 --> 13:45.030
how these people will be sent out.

13:45.030 --> 13:46.030
All you need to do

13:46.550 --> 13:47.670
is rescue them.

13:48.510 --> 13:50.240
Ms. Su, you are so resourceful.

13:50.270 --> 13:51.470
Why don't you teach me

13:51.600 --> 13:52.660
how to rescue them?

13:53.550 --> 13:54.610
Two firearms units

13:55.440 --> 13:56.960
with rows of Western muskets.

13:56.960 --> 13:57.720
They're watching those thousands of men

13:57.720 --> 13:59.050
without even blinking.

13:59.270 --> 14:00.240
I'm barehanded.

14:00.270 --> 14:02.390
I-I'm a scholar—utterly defenseless.

14:02.390 --> 14:03.670
I'm not the Monkey King.

14:03.670 --> 14:05.070
You think I can use magic?

14:05.670 --> 14:06.240
Wifey,

14:06.670 --> 14:08.670
do I look like the Monkey King to you?

14:09.470 --> 14:10.930
You look like a tea farmer.

14:11.200 --> 14:12.030
Chang,

14:13.150 --> 14:14.480
I can't just sit by and watch those men

14:14.480 --> 14:15.880
being tortured to death.

14:16.390 --> 14:17.720
I simply cannot bear it.

14:18.270 --> 14:20.400
Please, I'm begging you to help me too.

14:20.790 --> 14:21.840
You... Please.

14:22.600 --> 14:23.360
Get up.

14:30.510 --> 14:31.240
You...

14:34.510 --> 14:35.240
Ms. Bai,

14:36.510 --> 14:38.630
will those thousands of men

14:39.270 --> 14:40.200
really die?

14:41.630 --> 14:42.670
They really will.

14:43.440 --> 14:45.200
They were all Li Cheng's former soldiers.

14:45.200 --> 14:46.840
Before they became soldiers,

14:46.840 --> 14:48.100
they were just farmers

14:48.270 --> 14:49.320
and merchants.

14:49.670 --> 14:50.240
Well...

14:51.360 --> 14:53.550
Aren't they just ordinary people then?

14:53.550 --> 14:54.200
Exactly.

14:55.390 --> 14:55.910
Then I...

14:55.910 --> 14:56.970
Alright, alright.

14:57.630 --> 14:58.560
Let's stop here.

14:59.120 --> 14:59.720
Yimei,

15:00.120 --> 15:00.670
I'm afraid we can't help you

15:00.670 --> 15:01.750
with this favor.

15:02.150 --> 15:03.080
Please understand.

15:03.080 --> 15:04.000
We really can't help.

15:04.000 --> 15:05.200
There's more.

15:06.630 --> 15:07.670
I've rented boats

15:08.670 --> 15:09.720
to take them away

15:10.080 --> 15:11.410
and send them back home.

15:12.720 --> 15:14.320
You'd be that kind-hearted?

15:14.750 --> 15:16.810
You, sending these people home?

15:18.000 --> 15:19.750
More likely you'll ship them off
somewhere else

15:19.750 --> 15:20.600
and round them up again

15:20.600 --> 15:22.120
to start another rebellion.

15:22.120 --> 15:24.320
When the imperial court investigates,

15:24.360 --> 15:25.320
my ancestors' graves will be dug up

15:25.320 --> 15:27.080
before I even know what's happening.

15:27.080 --> 15:27.940
Well, you can't

15:27.960 --> 15:29.090
fool your partners.

15:29.670 --> 15:32.000
As long as you can
get those people onto the boats,

15:32.000 --> 15:33.720
I'll arrange everything properly.

15:33.720 --> 15:35.390
Those who want to farm can farm,

15:35.390 --> 15:38.120
and those who want to do business
will get capital.

15:38.120 --> 15:39.000
This war

15:39.270 --> 15:41.200
has claimed enough lives already.

15:43.270 --> 15:45.080
To rescue thousands of people

15:45.720 --> 15:47.390
in front of two firearms units,

15:47.390 --> 15:48.150
without giving Jiu

15:48.150 --> 15:49.410
any excuse to catch us—

15:49.720 --> 15:51.250
that's simply impossible.

15:52.720 --> 15:53.790
Do those prisoners

15:54.000 --> 15:55.550
know they're going to be killed?

15:55.550 --> 15:56.550
Of course they do.

15:59.390 --> 16:01.510
Ms. Su spending money to save people
is a noble act.

16:01.510 --> 16:02.910
You know better than I do.

16:03.750 --> 16:04.550
Now,

16:05.120 --> 16:06.600
if the prisoners know they'll be killed

16:06.600 --> 16:08.200
and cause trouble on the way,

16:08.390 --> 16:10.240
we'll lose our heads all the same.

16:10.240 --> 16:11.120
I think...

16:12.150 --> 16:13.120
you must do it.

16:13.670 --> 16:14.790
-You...
-Chang.

16:15.320 --> 16:16.200
You're right.

16:17.600 --> 16:19.260
Madam Gu sees things clearly.

16:21.000 --> 16:22.670
-Wifey...
-Hurry. Get up.

16:23.080 --> 16:24.410
D-Don't kneel anymore.

16:26.390 --> 16:26.990
Thank you.

16:35.960 --> 16:36.720
Come on, man,

16:37.200 --> 16:37.960
cut me.

16:38.600 --> 16:39.800
My head really hurts.

16:45.320 --> 16:46.380
Guys, please rise!

16:49.080 --> 16:50.120
-My Lord.
-Those rebels—

16:50.120 --> 16:51.390
are they working efficiently?

16:51.390 --> 16:52.840
At first, they were lazy and slacking off.

16:52.840 --> 16:53.360
We picked out a few

16:53.360 --> 16:54.390
and beat them half to death.

16:54.390 --> 16:55.750
Now they're much more obedient.

16:55.750 --> 16:56.880
Let's go take a look!

17:04.440 --> 17:05.510
How's their food?

17:05.720 --> 17:06.510
Well, no complaints.

17:06.510 --> 17:08.510
Better than what they got in prison.

17:11.480 --> 17:12.270
Is that so?

17:13.069 --> 17:14.730
Don't pocket too much silver.

17:15.109 --> 17:17.170
After all, we still need them to work.

17:17.440 --> 17:18.440
We wouldn't dare.

17:24.270 --> 17:25.000
What's this?

17:25.310 --> 17:27.369
My Lord, this is vegetable porridge.

17:35.100 --> 17:35.950
Is this meat?

17:36.680 --> 17:38.160
This is a worm from the vegetables.

17:38.160 --> 17:39.960
How could we give them real meat?

17:43.400 --> 17:44.660
You can't be like this!

17:45.640 --> 17:47.160
They're doing heavy labor every day—

17:47.160 --> 17:48.690
and you feed them just this?

17:48.830 --> 17:50.640
They won't have any strength, you know?

17:50.640 --> 17:51.160
My Lord,

17:51.510 --> 17:52.750
if they had any more strength,

17:52.750 --> 17:53.750
they would rebel.

17:53.880 --> 17:55.720
This humble servant remembers
your lordship's instructions.

17:55.720 --> 17:56.590
Keeping these people alive

17:56.590 --> 17:57.680
is just trouble anyway.

17:57.680 --> 17:59.480
Feed them less and beat them more—

17:59.480 --> 18:00.070
in just a few months,

18:00.070 --> 18:01.680
half of them will be worn down to death.

18:01.680 --> 18:02.740
Do this gradually,

18:03.240 --> 18:04.770
and they won't even resist.

18:08.440 --> 18:09.550
Come on, let's go. Turn around.

18:09.550 --> 18:10.680
You're quite sharp.

18:11.240 --> 18:11.840
Come back!

18:17.400 --> 18:18.060
Put it down.

18:25.240 --> 18:26.500
What are you carrying?

18:27.240 --> 18:27.720
Sir,

18:28.350 --> 18:30.160
while we were constructing
the coastal embankment just now,

18:30.160 --> 18:31.560
we found two jars of gold.

18:31.790 --> 18:32.880
We were just trying to find a chance

18:32.880 --> 18:34.280
to bring them over to you.

18:34.510 --> 18:35.720
Two jars of gold?

18:50.200 --> 18:51.260
What are you doing?

19:03.160 --> 19:04.000
Stop right there!

19:04.000 --> 19:04.600
Don't run!

19:17.270 --> 19:17.880
No, no, no!

19:18.200 --> 19:19.070
One missed shot,

19:19.070 --> 19:20.560
and I'm as good as dead!

19:20.640 --> 19:21.440
Surround them!

19:21.440 --> 19:22.000
Hurry!

19:22.480 --> 19:23.680
Quick! Quick! Quick!

19:30.830 --> 19:31.830
You bastards!

19:32.640 --> 19:33.640
Don't you dare...

19:34.880 --> 19:35.550
Let me...

19:35.830 --> 19:37.160
out!

19:39.110 --> 19:41.570
Please, let me out!

19:47.480 --> 19:48.140
Stay still!

19:48.440 --> 19:49.840
Or I'll stab you to death!

19:50.310 --> 19:51.110
Mr. Gu!

19:52.070 --> 19:52.880
Mr. Gu!

19:53.680 --> 19:54.480
What's wrong?

19:54.510 --> 19:56.160
Something's happened
at the coastal embankment.

19:56.160 --> 19:56.960
Something...

19:57.400 --> 19:58.680
something terrible has happened!

19:58.680 --> 19:59.720
What terrible thing has happened?

19:59.720 --> 20:00.580
Marshal Jiu...

20:02.200 --> 20:04.130
has been captured by those rebels.

20:04.310 --> 20:05.000
Nonsense!

20:05.310 --> 20:06.880
Marshal Jiu is a legendary hero.

20:06.880 --> 20:08.160
How could he be captured so easily?

20:08.160 --> 20:09.640
How would I know?

20:09.920 --> 20:11.560
Marshal Jiu is a titled lord.

20:11.680 --> 20:13.070
If anything happens to him

20:13.070 --> 20:14.030
in my jurisdiction,

20:14.030 --> 20:15.640
I can't bear that responsibility.

20:15.640 --> 20:16.960
Please come with me to check it out.

20:16.960 --> 20:17.960
This is terrible!

20:18.510 --> 20:20.160
My family is making braised ribs today!

20:20.160 --> 20:21.350
Let's have a bite first,

20:21.350 --> 20:22.550
then I'll go with you.

20:23.400 --> 20:25.200
You still think about ribs?

20:25.240 --> 20:26.750
If anything happens to Marshal Jiu,

20:26.750 --> 20:30.040
they'll tie me up at Caishikou
and flay me alive.

20:30.070 --> 20:31.920
I'll be the ribs then!

20:32.510 --> 20:33.260
You know?

20:33.440 --> 20:34.830
Just come with me!

20:37.240 --> 20:38.200
Release Marshal Jiu now!

20:38.200 --> 20:39.530
Let Marshal Jiu go!

20:42.750 --> 20:43.680
Release him now!

20:57.000 --> 20:58.720
Release Marshal Jiu immediately!

20:58.720 --> 20:59.790
Let Marshal Jiu go!

21:01.000 --> 21:01.750
Release him!

21:02.680 --> 21:04.010
-Hurry, hurry!
-Hurry!

21:05.640 --> 21:06.350
Mr. Gu!

21:08.960 --> 21:09.440
Come on.

21:09.590 --> 21:10.070
Duck!

21:10.070 --> 21:10.550
Hurry!

21:13.550 --> 21:14.310
Mr. Gu,

21:14.400 --> 21:15.730
we can't go any further.

21:15.750 --> 21:16.590
Stray bullets are flying!

21:16.590 --> 21:17.450
What happened?

21:17.610 --> 21:18.970
How could this happen?

21:19.270 --> 21:20.260
They tricked Marshal Jiu

21:20.260 --> 21:21.310
by claiming they'd dug up gold.

21:21.310 --> 21:22.350
Marshal Jiu was off his guard,

21:22.350 --> 21:23.310
and they got him into a large barrel

21:23.310 --> 21:24.270
and carried him away!

21:24.270 --> 21:25.750
Got him into a large barrel?

21:25.750 --> 21:26.880
What kind of barrel?

21:26.880 --> 21:27.430
Well...

21:27.640 --> 21:29.200
I'm asking you, what kind of barrel?

21:29.200 --> 21:30.000
A rice barrel!

21:30.030 --> 21:31.040
A rice barrel?

21:34.270 --> 21:34.830
Heizi!

21:34.830 --> 21:35.440
Be careful!

21:35.440 --> 21:36.510
Over here! Here! Over here!

21:36.510 --> 21:37.720
I was only gone for one day.

21:37.720 --> 21:39.660
How did such a major incident happen?

21:39.660 --> 21:41.060
Where did you get the hat?

21:41.480 --> 21:42.750
Marshal Jiu gave it to me.

21:42.750 --> 21:43.490
He said,

21:43.550 --> 21:44.120
"Heizi,

21:44.160 --> 21:45.620
you're really something.

21:45.720 --> 21:46.440
Why not stay here

21:46.440 --> 21:47.680
and serve as a battalion commander
or higher,

21:47.680 --> 21:49.310
earning glory with your sword and gun?"

21:49.310 --> 21:50.160
I haven't even had the chance

21:50.160 --> 21:51.160
to thank him yet...

21:51.160 --> 21:51.960
I'm not joking with you!

21:51.960 --> 21:52.680
Be serious!

21:53.440 --> 21:54.440
What do they want?

21:55.790 --> 21:57.830
They want to get out of here, of course.

21:57.830 --> 21:58.690
Get out of here?

21:58.720 --> 21:59.310
They're locked

21:59.310 --> 22:00.750
underground all day with no human dignity.

22:00.750 --> 22:02.070
They'll die sooner or later anyway.

22:02.070 --> 22:02.890
Then they said

22:02.960 --> 22:04.640
they would only stop if Marshal Jiu agreed

22:04.640 --> 22:05.870
to let them go.

22:06.060 --> 22:07.210
T-That's impossible.

22:07.210 --> 22:08.160
If an entire battalion

22:08.160 --> 22:09.160
of people escape,

22:09.200 --> 22:11.130
our whole family will be executed!

22:12.000 --> 22:13.050
Let us go!

22:13.110 --> 22:13.900
Let us go,

22:13.960 --> 22:15.220
and we'll release him!

22:20.070 --> 22:20.790
Mr. Gu?

22:21.480 --> 22:22.240
Mr. Gu?

22:22.750 --> 22:23.550
Mr. Su,

22:24.200 --> 22:25.480
hurry and ask the Viceroy of Liangjiang

22:25.480 --> 22:26.680
to bring troops here!

22:26.680 --> 22:27.790
I can't handle this anymore!

22:27.790 --> 22:28.720
Well, I can't...

22:28.790 --> 22:30.110
But Marshal Jiu has given strict orders

22:30.110 --> 22:30.880
that no one is allowed to speak of this.

22:30.880 --> 22:31.920
He's afraid of losing face!

22:31.920 --> 22:33.720
He's not afraid of
losing his life, though.

22:33.720 --> 22:35.100
Among all of us here, the only person

22:35.100 --> 22:36.850
they'll actually listen to is you.

22:36.850 --> 22:38.720
Please think of something.

22:39.110 --> 22:40.750
My life and my family's lives

22:40.750 --> 22:43.430
are all depending on you!

22:46.200 --> 22:48.200
Braised lamb kidneys, fried combo,

22:48.200 --> 22:49.400
braised sea cucumber with scallions,

22:49.400 --> 22:50.530
and smoked venison,

22:50.680 --> 22:51.550
ready to serve!

22:58.400 --> 22:59.850
I'm here to deliver food!

23:01.000 --> 23:02.000
Stop right there!

23:18.160 --> 23:18.720
It's me,

23:19.070 --> 23:19.800
Gu Pingyuan!

23:20.240 --> 23:21.100
The Viceroy of Liangjiang

23:21.100 --> 23:23.240
sent me to supervise the repair work here!

23:23.240 --> 23:24.640
I need to see Marshal Jiu!

23:25.480 --> 23:26.540
Whatever you want,

23:26.720 --> 23:27.440
you can negotiate with me!

23:27.440 --> 23:28.440
Stop right there!

23:29.270 --> 23:30.400
Take off your robe!

23:51.070 --> 23:51.590
Go in!

23:56.270 --> 23:56.830
Move.

24:12.200 --> 24:12.920
Who are you?

24:13.510 --> 24:14.710
You're their leader?

24:15.400 --> 24:16.600
It's me, Gu Pingyuan,

24:16.640 --> 24:17.680
the one overseeing the repair work.

24:17.680 --> 24:18.880
I want to see Marshal Jiu.

24:18.880 --> 24:20.140
I'm here to see

24:20.350 --> 24:22.030
if there's a way I can help you all.

24:22.030 --> 24:22.780
Jiu

24:23.240 --> 24:24.720
killed so many of us.

24:25.510 --> 24:26.110
Today we'll

24:26.110 --> 24:27.350
slice him up and drink to it!

24:27.350 --> 24:28.920
What help could we need from you?

24:28.920 --> 24:30.910
-Kill him!
-Kill him!

24:31.000 --> 24:33.680
-Kill him!
-Kill him!

24:33.880 --> 24:35.080
-Kill Jiu!
-Kill him!

24:35.920 --> 24:37.490
If you wanted to kill him,
wouldn't you have done it already?

24:37.490 --> 24:38.960
Why wait until now, right?

24:40.460 --> 24:41.600
Kill Jiu!

24:41.790 --> 24:42.920
Whatever you want,

24:43.160 --> 24:44.620
it's open to negotiation.

24:45.780 --> 24:46.980
What do we want?

24:51.240 --> 24:53.060
We want to rebel. How about that?

24:53.510 --> 24:54.270
Don't do it!

24:55.200 --> 24:56.590
The war has already killed
too many people.

24:56.590 --> 24:57.920
No more should die!

24:58.480 --> 24:59.290
If that's how you want to negotiate,

24:59.290 --> 25:00.890
you might as well kill me now.

25:01.790 --> 25:03.070
What do you suggest then?

25:03.070 --> 25:04.490
If you ask me—

25:04.590 --> 25:06.020
I'll sacrifice my career

25:06.440 --> 25:07.880
to plead with the Viceroy

25:07.920 --> 25:09.030
and Marshal Jiu on your behalf!

25:09.030 --> 25:10.360
I'll ask for their mercy

25:10.510 --> 25:11.710
to let you all go home!

25:12.000 --> 25:12.920
From now on,

25:13.240 --> 25:14.110
you can all be law-abiding citizens!

25:14.110 --> 25:15.240
How does that sound?

25:17.440 --> 25:18.770
Law-abiding citizens?

25:20.440 --> 25:22.260
Gu Pingyuan, oh, Gu Pingyuan.

25:22.510 --> 25:23.570
Back then in Hefei,

25:23.720 --> 25:26.000
you also promised
those surrendered soldiers

25:26.000 --> 25:28.330
they could live as law-abiding citizens.

25:34.350 --> 25:35.200
You know me?

25:36.550 --> 25:37.270
Guys,

25:37.750 --> 25:39.210
do you know who this man is?

25:39.550 --> 25:40.880
He's the Gu Pingyuan

25:40.900 --> 25:43.300
who drove our General Li Cheng
to his death!

25:51.830 --> 25:52.440
Guys,

25:53.070 --> 25:54.840
I didn't kill General Li!

25:55.070 --> 25:56.000
Are you for real?

25:57.030 --> 25:58.430
I want to see Marshal Jiu!

26:02.160 --> 26:04.130
Don't beat him to death! Don't kill him!

26:04.130 --> 26:05.340
What if Jiu actually wants to

26:05.340 --> 26:06.140
see him later?

26:06.160 --> 26:07.020
Carry him away!

26:21.880 --> 26:22.430
Get up!

26:23.510 --> 26:24.590
You've beaten me badly.

26:24.590 --> 26:25.000
Hurry up!

26:25.000 --> 26:25.800
I can't get up.

26:26.000 --> 26:27.000
Cut the nonsense! Get up!

26:27.000 --> 26:28.000
Alright, alright.

26:28.000 --> 26:29.030
I can walk, I can walk.

26:29.030 --> 26:30.090
You can let go of me.

26:38.550 --> 26:39.030
Yu'er.

26:42.200 --> 26:43.130
Why are you here?

26:43.310 --> 26:43.850
If I hadn't come,

26:43.850 --> 26:45.440
were you really planning to
make me a widow?

26:45.440 --> 26:45.840
You...

26:45.960 --> 26:47.820
You recognized me even like this?

26:48.200 --> 26:48.550
Well,

26:48.640 --> 26:49.310
when I was being

26:49.310 --> 26:49.960
beaten up earlier,

26:49.960 --> 26:51.620
why didn't you come to save me?

26:53.680 --> 26:54.610
There were so many people.

26:54.610 --> 26:55.940
I'm not stupid like you.

26:55.960 --> 26:57.550
You think you're made of iron?

26:57.550 --> 26:59.070
Come on, put your arm over me.

26:59.070 --> 27:00.070
Come on, let's go.

27:00.310 --> 27:01.720
Don't mess things up here for me.

27:01.720 --> 27:03.650
I still need to talk to Marshal Jiu.

27:04.310 --> 27:05.880
You're biting the hand that feeds you,

27:05.880 --> 27:06.550
aren't you?

27:06.750 --> 27:08.950
Without me, you would've died long ago.

27:09.000 --> 27:10.160
Why haven't you gone over yet?

27:10.160 --> 27:11.420
Jiu has been urging us!

27:11.440 --> 27:12.100
Got it!

27:12.310 --> 27:13.270
Coming right away!

27:13.270 --> 27:13.960
I'll shoot him with one arrow,

27:13.960 --> 27:14.960
and we'll escape.

27:15.200 --> 27:16.400
Stop messing around.

27:17.510 --> 27:18.710
Put down your weapon.

27:19.790 --> 27:21.270
Let's walk out with our heads held high.

27:21.270 --> 27:22.330
I'll show you how your man

27:22.330 --> 27:24.060
pulls off a miraculous escape.

27:39.790 --> 27:40.520
Marshal Jiu.

27:47.880 --> 27:49.280
Gu, you're a man of honor.

27:50.400 --> 27:51.790
Just now, when I heard someone barge in,

27:51.790 --> 27:52.720
I knew it was you.

27:54.110 --> 27:55.350
No one else

27:55.440 --> 27:56.440
has such loyalty.

27:57.310 --> 27:57.830
You've won

27:57.830 --> 27:59.090
battles all your life.

27:59.240 --> 27:59.680
How did you end up

27:59.680 --> 28:01.210
stuffed into a rice barrel?

28:01.270 --> 28:01.750
And I got

28:01.750 --> 28:03.080
beaten up for no reason.

28:03.110 --> 28:04.370
Who arranged all this?

28:06.960 --> 28:07.890
Who's laughing?

28:08.680 --> 28:09.540
M-Marshal Jiu.

28:11.240 --> 28:11.750
Come on.

28:13.960 --> 28:14.820
This is my wife.

28:15.790 --> 28:16.960
She was worried about me,

28:16.960 --> 28:18.360
so she came to protect me.

28:21.590 --> 28:23.960
We're going to release
the imperial court's prisoners—

28:23.960 --> 28:26.960
our families could lose their heads,
yet you still...

28:27.270 --> 28:28.440
We've already staked everything on this.

28:28.440 --> 28:30.310
We should've avoided complicated things.

28:30.310 --> 28:30.960
You officials all

28:30.960 --> 28:33.640
deceive your superiors
and cover for each other.

28:33.640 --> 28:35.350
Well, how to spin a story

28:35.400 --> 28:36.930
about releasing prisoners

28:37.400 --> 28:39.160
is all up to your silver tongues,

28:39.160 --> 28:39.640
right?

28:39.960 --> 28:41.400
Just leave me out of this.

28:44.270 --> 28:47.070
Well, if something goes wrong,
it's your problem.

28:48.960 --> 28:50.160
How is it just my problem?

28:50.160 --> 28:51.560
You're in this with them.

28:52.350 --> 28:52.830
I...

28:55.900 --> 28:56.760
M-Marshal Jiu,

28:56.770 --> 28:57.770
a word in private.

29:02.130 --> 29:03.190
Come on, wifey.

29:03.270 --> 29:04.160
Take a look. It's eye-opening.

29:04.160 --> 29:05.130
Y-You...

29:05.160 --> 29:05.830
Have a look.

29:05.880 --> 29:06.340
This...

29:15.270 --> 29:16.400
We're about to leave.

29:16.400 --> 29:18.060
Do you want to come out and see?

29:18.110 --> 29:19.310
Marshal Jiu, you too.

29:28.480 --> 29:29.010
Let's go.

29:41.310 --> 29:42.010
Guys,

29:42.720 --> 29:45.390
board the ships by squad and unit.
No rushing.

29:58.960 --> 29:59.700
Gu,

30:00.110 --> 30:01.040
this is my child.

30:04.550 --> 30:05.010
Come on.

30:08.480 --> 30:10.590
Thank you, Gu,
for making this possible.

30:10.590 --> 30:11.440
From here on,

30:11.960 --> 30:13.220
we'll be worlds apart,

30:13.830 --> 30:15.160
unlikely to meet again.

30:17.310 --> 30:18.570
Take care of yourself.

30:22.030 --> 30:22.640
Ms. Yu'er,

30:23.310 --> 30:24.570
take care of yourself.

32:00.960 --> 32:01.700
Marshal Jiu.

32:03.000 --> 32:03.800
Well...

32:04.880 --> 32:06.720
It's been a pleasure working with you.

32:06.720 --> 32:08.180
Earlier, Ms. Su mentioned

32:08.480 --> 32:10.900
wanting to buy those prisoners from you.

32:11.200 --> 32:12.240
She was afraid
you wouldn't have the courage

32:12.240 --> 32:13.300
to accept the deal.

32:13.590 --> 32:15.550
I laughed out loud when I heard that.

32:15.550 --> 32:16.880
You and "timid" don't belong
in the same sentence,

32:16.880 --> 32:17.350
right?

32:21.200 --> 32:21.860
However...

32:23.030 --> 32:24.160
you really pulled off

32:24.160 --> 32:26.290
the self-sacrifice act brilliantly.

32:26.440 --> 32:27.970
You acted better than I did.

32:29.070 --> 32:29.730
As I should.

32:30.680 --> 32:31.480
Let me ask you.

32:32.680 --> 32:33.650
I took their gold

32:33.720 --> 32:34.980
to handle this matter.

32:35.000 --> 32:36.330
What did they offer you?

32:36.590 --> 32:37.610
I want the truth.

32:41.070 --> 32:42.000
Actually, all I wanted was

32:42.000 --> 32:43.330
to save whoever I could.

32:44.200 --> 32:45.190
The war is over.

32:45.880 --> 32:47.640
I don't want to see any more deaths.

32:47.640 --> 32:48.300
That's all.

32:52.240 --> 32:53.030
This chest of gold

32:53.030 --> 32:54.960
will help me demobilize
my 50,000 veterans.

32:54.960 --> 32:56.420
If they can't afford food,

32:56.640 --> 32:58.170
they'll become rebels too.

32:59.000 --> 33:01.260
We've both bought ourselves some peace.

33:19.240 --> 33:20.350
That old fox Rui Lin

33:20.350 --> 33:22.350
actually dared to double-cross me.

33:22.440 --> 33:23.270
Master, please calm down.

33:23.270 --> 33:24.960
-It's not the time to get angry.
-Father.

33:24.960 --> 33:26.090
Where have you been?

33:27.200 --> 33:27.790
I just came back from

33:27.790 --> 33:29.790
the coastal embankment in Nantong.

33:31.720 --> 33:34.250
The Viceroy and Marshal Jiu
also went, right?

33:34.510 --> 33:36.640
Marshal Jiu went, but not the  Viceroy.

33:37.240 --> 33:38.480
I heard Marshal Jiu was fine,

33:38.480 --> 33:39.030
so I came back.

33:39.030 --> 33:40.270
Good boy, good boy.

33:44.160 --> 33:44.960
What's wrong?

33:45.960 --> 33:48.000
The Master was just about to ask you that.

33:48.000 --> 33:48.720
Ask me?

33:49.000 --> 33:49.930
How would I know?

33:53.350 --> 33:53.960
They say

33:54.920 --> 33:56.030
Rui Lin has gone back

33:56.030 --> 33:58.270
on his promise about the salt fields.

34:10.760 --> 34:11.480
Jiu.

34:11.630 --> 34:13.280
Why haven't you gone back yet?

34:13.280 --> 34:15.280
Out having fun with your troops?

34:15.670 --> 34:17.510
Your camp is having
a malaria outbreak right now.

34:17.510 --> 34:19.239
I've already sent physicians.

34:19.320 --> 34:21.050
Go back and check immediately.

34:21.630 --> 34:22.880
Move the soldiers and the prisoners

34:22.880 --> 34:23.880
who haven't caught malaria

34:23.880 --> 34:25.000
to another camp.

34:26.760 --> 34:27.400
Yes, sir.

34:32.840 --> 34:34.190
The sedan chair for your wife

34:34.190 --> 34:35.550
awaits at the foot of the mountain.

34:35.550 --> 34:37.480
I'll have someone escort her back.

34:37.840 --> 34:39.400
The winds and waves here are treacherous.

34:39.400 --> 34:41.960
A lady of your standing shouldn't be
in such a dangerous place.

34:41.960 --> 34:44.710
When your husband's merits
bring you an imperial title,

34:44.710 --> 34:46.840
I'll come to offer my congratulations.

34:46.840 --> 34:47.320
Please.

34:55.320 --> 34:57.980
The coastal embankment repairs
are going well.

34:58.000 --> 34:58.630
Yes.

34:59.360 --> 35:01.360
After the repair work is completed,

35:01.780 --> 35:03.240
I'll still need your help.

35:03.800 --> 35:05.000
Walk with me for a bit.

35:07.110 --> 35:09.240
This malaria came on really fiercely.

35:11.000 --> 35:11.780
However,

35:11.960 --> 35:13.690
those who died were all rebels.

35:14.840 --> 35:17.320
Several thousand people died
in just one night.

35:17.320 --> 35:18.720
It's truly frightening.

35:20.000 --> 35:20.800
Fortunately,

35:21.480 --> 35:22.110
not a single soldier

35:22.110 --> 35:24.110
of the imperial court was infected.

35:24.150 --> 35:26.780
Heaven is watching over us,

35:27.230 --> 35:31.290
and the Emperor and Empress Dowager
are blessed with boundless fortune.

35:32.030 --> 35:32.890
You're right.

35:33.960 --> 35:36.420
They are all blessed
with heavenly fortune.

35:36.550 --> 35:39.150
Long live the Emperor
and the Empress Dowager.

35:41.880 --> 35:43.590
Those who have been infected

35:43.800 --> 35:44.830
must be careful.

35:45.320 --> 35:46.520
Carrying the disease

35:46.550 --> 35:48.320
and running around everywhere—

35:48.320 --> 35:50.030
if the court finds out,

35:50.710 --> 35:52.110
they'll show no mercy.

35:53.510 --> 35:54.590
Please rest assured.

35:54.590 --> 35:56.760
They've all returned to their hometowns.

35:56.760 --> 35:58.070
Those who farm will farm,

35:58.070 --> 35:59.800
and those who trade will trade.

36:00.110 --> 36:01.320
The war is over.

36:01.880 --> 36:03.340
No more people should die.

36:14.510 --> 36:15.230
I agree.

36:18.590 --> 36:19.440
Tell me,

36:19.760 --> 36:21.230
what if I let you

36:21.230 --> 36:23.090
run the salt fields in Lianghuai?

36:23.110 --> 36:25.400
That is the most profitable business
in Jiangnan.

36:25.400 --> 36:26.860
Do you have such ambition?

36:28.590 --> 36:30.510
The salt fields in the Lianghuai region

36:30.510 --> 36:32.570
are Jiangnan's primary livelihood.

36:32.630 --> 36:35.400
Millions of people depend on them
for their living.

36:35.400 --> 36:36.230
How could we really

36:36.230 --> 36:38.070
hand them over to that father and son?

36:38.070 --> 36:39.800
They'd burst from greed alone.

36:40.360 --> 36:41.990
If they mismanage them,

36:42.320 --> 36:45.050
something terrible will happen
sooner or later.

36:45.280 --> 36:47.510
Is the imperial court's management
any better?

36:47.510 --> 36:48.510
I doubt it.

36:49.480 --> 36:50.230
It's just

36:50.250 --> 36:51.760
that money that should have been earned
by merchants

36:51.760 --> 36:54.360
has ended up in the hands of
corrupt officials.

36:54.670 --> 36:56.480
It's really rare to find someone
who talks back

36:56.480 --> 36:57.760
as much as you do.

37:01.760 --> 37:02.880
The imperial court's salt administration

37:02.880 --> 37:04.360
has long been a mess.

37:04.800 --> 37:05.800
What I want

37:06.590 --> 37:07.670
is for the people of Lianghuai

37:07.670 --> 37:09.730
to be freed from the imperial court's

37:09.800 --> 37:10.630
oppression

37:11.000 --> 37:11.920
without falling into

37:11.920 --> 37:13.580
the clutches of the Li family.

37:15.000 --> 37:16.840
I want the Salt Industry Guild
to take the lead,

37:16.840 --> 37:18.400
and as long as they pay taxes uniformly,

37:18.400 --> 37:21.000
I'll let them manage
the salt fields monopoly.

37:24.000 --> 37:25.480
This is confidential.

37:26.190 --> 37:28.030
I've only told you.

37:29.000 --> 37:29.460
Well...

37:29.630 --> 37:31.490
True benevolence can seem cruel.

37:31.960 --> 37:32.880
If you care so much about

37:32.880 --> 37:34.370
your friendship with him,

37:34.630 --> 37:35.880
I'll replace you.

37:36.550 --> 37:37.630
If I find out

37:37.880 --> 37:39.480
you've leaked a word of this,

37:39.880 --> 37:41.080
I'll find some charge

37:41.590 --> 37:43.260
and have you exiled again.

37:43.800 --> 37:45.630
Your personal loyalties,

37:46.000 --> 37:47.710
compared to the livelihood
of Lianghuai's people,

37:47.710 --> 37:48.360
are

37:49.000 --> 37:50.280
worthless.

37:51.110 --> 37:54.170
Don't blame me for being heartless
when the time comes—

37:54.760 --> 37:55.630
remember this.

37:56.230 --> 37:57.320
Look at

37:57.550 --> 37:58.630
what this letter says.

37:58.630 --> 38:00.790
The letter says that the Viceroy

38:00.960 --> 38:02.920
wants to rebuild the salt fields
in Lianghuai,

38:02.920 --> 38:04.320
but change them from state-operated

38:04.320 --> 38:06.880
to a system where the Salt Industry Guild

38:06.920 --> 38:09.100
pays fixed rent and taxes to the court!

38:09.320 --> 38:10.110
While the Salt Industry Guild

38:10.110 --> 38:12.000
will be controlled
by the Liangjiang Viceroy's Office,

38:12.000 --> 38:13.060
which will appoint

38:13.070 --> 38:13.960
a representative later,

38:13.960 --> 38:14.690
Gu Pingyuan.

38:15.400 --> 38:17.710
That way, our family's private salt fields

38:17.710 --> 38:19.230
will cleverly become

38:19.710 --> 38:20.540
"state-run"!

38:21.230 --> 38:21.630
It's just

38:21.630 --> 38:23.960
that they will operate
under a mixed state-private model.

38:23.960 --> 38:24.760
That's right.

38:25.510 --> 38:26.070
Exactly!

38:26.480 --> 38:28.550
I think since
the Liangjiang Viceroy's Office

38:28.550 --> 38:30.110
wants to get involved,

38:30.190 --> 38:31.450
we might as well openly

38:31.480 --> 38:32.110
make our move

38:32.110 --> 38:32.910
and let him in!

38:33.230 --> 38:34.280
They may come in,

38:34.320 --> 38:35.650
but we won't necessarily

38:35.650 --> 38:36.510
let them leave.

38:37.840 --> 38:38.630
It says here

38:39.550 --> 38:42.110
that the operating rights will
belong to the guild.

38:42.110 --> 38:43.150
And who is the guild?

38:43.150 --> 38:44.190
Isn't it us

38:44.190 --> 38:45.070
and Gu Pingyuan?

38:45.070 --> 38:46.670
Then we should seize the initiative

38:46.670 --> 38:47.680
and choose first

38:47.710 --> 38:50.030
which salt-administered provinces
our family will manage.

38:50.030 --> 38:51.670
Jiangsu and Jiangxi—

38:51.800 --> 38:53.630
they are major salt-administered provinces

38:53.630 --> 38:55.110
and places where merchants

38:55.110 --> 38:56.970
from all over the country gather.

38:57.510 --> 38:58.230
Jingdezhen

38:58.230 --> 38:59.400
and the Weaving Bureau

38:59.400 --> 39:00.320
are where

39:00.360 --> 39:02.090
the biggest merchants gather.

39:02.710 --> 39:03.170
Father,

39:03.510 --> 39:04.800
let's take those two provinces

39:04.800 --> 39:06.110
and leave the rest to Gu Pingyuan.

39:06.110 --> 39:07.150
We'll operate independently.

39:07.150 --> 39:09.030
At year's end, just like the Westerners,

39:09.030 --> 39:10.150
we will set up a Board of Directors

39:10.150 --> 39:12.280
based on profits
to make the final decision—

39:12.280 --> 39:13.630
according to the scale of operations

39:13.630 --> 39:14.830
and amount of profit,

39:15.000 --> 39:16.480
the losers will have to withdraw.

39:16.480 --> 39:17.790
Let's use this method

39:17.840 --> 39:20.230
to squeeze
the Liangjiang Viceroy's Office out.

39:20.230 --> 39:21.110
Then everything else

39:21.110 --> 39:22.970
will be under our control, right?

39:25.280 --> 39:26.000
Is this

39:26.550 --> 39:27.840
someone else's analysis

39:27.840 --> 39:29.280
or your own thinking?

39:33.150 --> 39:34.360
I figured it out myself.

39:34.360 --> 39:34.890
Just now.

39:35.230 --> 39:35.800
Just now?

39:43.480 --> 39:44.740
How confident are you?

39:48.280 --> 39:49.590
I don't want to lose again.

39:49.590 --> 39:50.590
I want to win once.

39:53.670 --> 39:54.880
One, two!

39:55.400 --> 39:56.730
-Heave-ho!
-Heave-ho!

