41:15.320 --> 41:17.630
-It's connected!
-It's connected!

41:47.190 --> 41:47.880
Everyone!

41:49.030 --> 41:51.550
Today marks the completion
of the Nantong coastal embankment.

41:51.550 --> 41:53.680
A weight has been lifted from my heart.

41:53.760 --> 41:54.360
Mr. Li Qin,

41:54.590 --> 41:55.300
Mr. Gu,

41:55.440 --> 41:57.570
on behalf of the people of Liangjiang,

41:57.760 --> 41:59.090
I offer you both a toast.

42:00.190 --> 42:00.710
You're too kind.

42:00.710 --> 42:01.640
You're too kind.

42:02.190 --> 42:02.650
Cheers.

42:05.070 --> 42:05.730
-Sit.
-Sit.

42:08.630 --> 42:10.110
Our Li family from the capital

42:10.110 --> 42:10.840
is honored to

42:10.840 --> 42:12.920
do something practical for the people

42:12.920 --> 42:14.070
of Liangjiang.

42:15.280 --> 42:17.000
The coastal embankment is well built!

42:17.000 --> 42:18.530
With the keystone in place,

42:19.320 --> 42:20.230
barring any unforeseen circumstances,

42:20.230 --> 42:22.880
it will stand for 200 to 300 years!

42:23.920 --> 42:24.800
The people of Nantong

42:24.800 --> 42:26.630
will no longer need to flee.

42:27.150 --> 42:28.880
The salt industry in Lianghuai

42:29.110 --> 42:31.710
will no longer fear
being ruined by floods too!

42:32.150 --> 42:35.010
These are all thanks to
Your Excellency's efforts.

42:35.110 --> 42:36.190
I drink to you.

42:41.110 --> 42:43.200
Li Million, you never change,

42:43.760 --> 42:45.570
always talking business.

42:47.710 --> 42:49.020
As a businessman,

42:50.070 --> 42:51.730
what else would he talk about?

42:52.150 --> 42:54.280
Your Excellency,
a distinguished guest has arrived!

42:54.280 --> 42:55.610
Quickly invite them in.

42:55.710 --> 42:56.170
Come on.

42:56.320 --> 42:57.280
A distinguished guest.
